'''Revival of Origin Invasion''' is an [[Invasion Stage]] that appears in {{4c}} [[Sacred Forest]] after clearing all [[Uncanny Legends]] sub-chapters on {{4c}} difficulty, similar to the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]]. [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]] debuts in this [[No Continues]] stage.

Upon completion, [[Revival of Origin]] will be back to normal and [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]] will be unlocked.

