==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]]

==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is an [[Origin Base (Enemy Base)|Origin Base]].
*1 [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]] spawns as the boss after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>.
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Othom]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The boss, though formidable with incredible damage, has a sizable blind spot that can be infiltrated by melee units with 250 or less range, which unfortunately is covered by many more threats that can push units away, giving her a chance to generate an [[Explosion]] that will wipe everything within its area of effect, including those in her otherwise safe blind spot. Every opportunity of damage should be exploited to rack up carnage, hopefully defeating the boss before support can arrive. It is also possible to outlast the onslaught, as the only respawning threats are Relic Doges and Sir Rels, both of which appear only occasionally. Nevertheless, players must be careful when timing their unit deployments, as even if they sneak melee units into her blind spot, a single hit on a unit behind them will create an Explosion that wipes them out.

While being a Sage reduces the effectiveness of various status effects, [[Ototo Corps|Breakerblast]] can still be viable if used well to create a window of opportunity, especially to cancel her attack. Furthermore, if an enemy is blocking the way to Dr. Nova's blindspot, they can be potentially knocked behind Nova.

It is recomended to use a [[Rich Cat]] here, as there are very few sources of money and Nova spawns almost instantly. It is also highly recommended not to use units with more than 250 range like [[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Bargain Cat]], [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] or [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] as they will trigger Nova's explosion, for the sake of making timing your units easier it is optimal to turn off your [[Speed Up]].
==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] - Highly durable Relic meatshield that is fast enough to enter the boss' blind spot without too much trouble. Although they will largely be unable to survive the boss' attacks, they can help hold the line against the other Relic peons, buying more time to stay within the boss' blind spot before being forced out.
*[[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] - Without [[Cat Combo]]s, Idi:NX at Level 50 can already deal a tremendous '''567,000''' damage per hit to the boss (over a tenth of her health and almost enough to instantly knock her back), and '''472,500''' to other Relics, and has the range to stay safe inside the boss' blind spot. While she can't survive one of the boss' attacks without either a Defense Combo or an upgraded Curseblast Foundation, the Explosion won't even scratch her. Proper timing with Idi:NX can provide a much easier victory.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Talented Awakened Bahamut Cat]] - With his Explosion and high speed, Awakened Bahamut can easily infiltrate Nova's blindspot and proceed to tear her apart with his devastating DPS. His Explosion can also snipe incoming peons, preventing them from even reaching him and interrupting his chain. He is not immune to Explosions, however, and will still be wiped out if Nova lands a hit on another unit, so be sure to time support units right.
*[[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] - Although the boss' Sage trait makes her massively resist debuffs, Doron's multiple instances of Freeze and especially Knockback can help regain some ground against her or disable her just long enough to sneak melee units into her blind spot, while potentially helping keep Othom and Oldhorn at bay. Just be mindful of her attack cycle as Doron could help her trigger an Explosion, eliminating your own stack.
*[[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] - His weakness of short range is turned into a strength thanks to the boss' blind spot, which he is fast enough to invade with some timing. Once he's in range, he can deal massive DPS to the boss, Relic Doges, and Oldhorn, although he will struggle against the Jackrabbits and Othoms as they outrange him.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Has just short enough range to enter the boss' blind spot with some speed clipping, and can deal consistent damage while nuking the J.J. Jackrabbits with their Massive Damage vs. Red.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] - Fast nukers that can slip into range with some timing and deal massive damage, potentially even multiple hits if no peons are active. Jelly Dumpling Cat's Wave can also chip incoming threats and wipe out weaker peons, while Supercar is able to slightly push back the boss if it lands a blow.
*[[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Ultimate Mecha Bun]] - For the first time since Primitive Souls, Mecha Bun can see some use here. Although it's only marginal, it still can do some decent work. He has enough speed to make it into Dr. Nova's blindspot in-between attacks, and as long as the peons don't push too hard or Nova spawns an explosion, he can slowly but surely accumulate some good damage to Dr. Nova. He's still massively outclassed by Royal Guard, but they can be used together for extra destruction.

